`node --import ./scripts/tsx.mjs ../proof.mjs sketch exact-head chromium`

Use the identical command on main with stage `red` to inspect the absent action; replace `chromium` with `webkit` for the second engine. The diagnostic baseline uses stage `baseline-send-controls` and WebKit. The current main subscription startup uses visible composer readiness instead of the retired chat.startup RPC wait.

**Not tested:** Production Gateway/model delivery, physical touch devices, native app carriers, release packages, complete dark-mode correctness, and theme-preference persistence. This is the real source Control UI with a synthetic fixture Gateway; it sends no external model/channel traffic. It proves frontend staging and serialized image content, not downstream model interpretation.

