Run from a clean source checkout with its frozen dependencies:
`node --import ./scripts/tsx.mjs <collector.mjs> comparison exact-head chromium`
and the same command with `webkit` in an environment with the pinned engine and its libraries. WebKit uses an isolated persistent profile for the native attachment/media storage contract. Current main starts chat through the subscription envelope; semantic composer/image readiness replaces the obsolete `chat.startup` RPC wait while all user behavior and downloaded-byte controls remain unchanged.

